            "parent_id": "qa",
            "title": "I just want it framed and on the wall. What is the cheapest sensible option?",
            "text": "<p>A wood frame without glass. You pay for the print and frame, not for glass and a mount.</p>"
          }
        },
        "b04": {
          "type": "grid_item",
          "settings": {
            "parent_id": "qa",
            "title": "Will the print be protected?",
            "text": "<p>There is no glass, so the printed surface is exposed. Keep it out of kitchens, bathrooms and places it will be touched.</p>"
          }
        },
